<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Tribune buy repeated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Tribune buy repeated.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Gruntal &amp; Co Inc analyst Rita Zanella Benson on Monday reiterated a buy recommendation on Tribune Co and set a 12-month price target of $47 on its stock.</p>
<p>--On Friday, the media company posted diluted per share earnings of $0.57 a share for the fourth quarter, including a $0.04 a share nonrecurring gain. &quot;The results were in line with our estimate and the street's consensus,&quot; Benson noted in a report.</p>
<p>--Her 1998 EPS estimate is $2.11.</p>
<p>--Tribune was trading up 3/8 at 36-1/2.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
